  "source": "Belimo, Energy Valve Modbus Register, V4.1 (15.01.2022)",
  "sources": [
    {
      "title": "Energy Valve Modbus Register",
      "version": "V4.1 (15.01.2022)",
      "url": "https://www.belimo.com/mam/general-documents/system_integration/Modbus/belimo_Modbus-Register_Energy-Valve_V4_1_en-gb.pdf",
      "note": "Modbus register description",
      "accessed": "2026-11-15",
      "sha256": "2a849c489a51ef1d76cc5b55779965bbf86ebeff16e89dc76da031be1c9fea49"
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Modbus RTU over RS-485: 1-8-N-2 by default (also N-1, E-1, O-1), 9600 to 115200 bd (factory 38400), address 1 to 247 (factory 1). Modbus TCP over Ethernet, port 502 by default.",
    "Registers in \"selected unit\" follow the unit selection registers (147 to 150).",
    "Totals are 32-bit unsigned values; scaling is as given in the manual (0.01 m³ for the m³ total, 1 for the others).",
    "All registers are holding registers (functions 3 and 6; 4, 2 and 16 also accepted). The manual numbers registers from 1 (No.) and from 0 (Address); the Address column is used here (address base 0).",
    "32-bit values take two consecutive registers, least significant word first.",
    "A register not supported by the device or its settings reads 65535.",
    "Written from the manufacturer's register description; not tested on a device."
  ],
  "protocol": "tcp+rtu",
  "unit_id": 1,
  "baudrate": 38400,
  "parity": "N",
  "databits": 8,
  "stopbits": 2,
  "byte_order": "big",
  "word_order": "little",
  "address_base": 0,
  "x_status": "official",
